      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    mean_1 = 8\n    mean_2 = 6\n    var_1 = 4\n    var_2 = 3\n    n1 = 5\n    n2 = 5\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    pooled_variance = (\n        ((n1 - 1) * var_1 ** 2) + ((n2 - 1) * var_2 ** 2)\n    ) / (n1 + n2 - 2)\n\n    t_value = (mean_1 - mean_2) / (\n        pooled_variance * (1 / n1 + 1 / n2)\n    ) ** 0.5\n\n    # Return the t-value rounded to two decimal places\n    return round(t_value, 2)\n```",
